Type a message and press Enter. Ctrl+P opens the command palette.


          ┌ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
          │ enter                   send message                    │
          │ shift+enter, alt+enter  new line                        │
          │ esc                     cancel / back                   │
          │ tab                     switch view (chat / map)        │
          │ ctrl+p                  command palette                 │
          │ ctrl+y                  copy to clipboard               │
          │ ctrl+t                  select text in the transcript   │
          │ ctrl+c                  interrupt agent                 │
          │ ctrl+q                  quit                            │
          │ ctrl+z                  suspend (resume with fg)        │
          │ shift+tab / arrows      move focus                      │
          │ enter                   activate focused element        │
          │ pgup / pgdn             scroll focused pane             │
          │ mouse                   click activates, wheel scrolls  │
          │                                                         │
          │                        [ Close ]                        │
◐ sending └─────────────────────────────────────────── esc to close ┘
